      {
        "text": "Mark Pulido is a Cerritos City Council member and its mayor pro tempore. He served on the ABC Unified School District Board from 2001 to 2011, including as board president. He was on the Cerritos City Council from 2011 to 2020, serving twice as mayor. He has worked as an Assembly consultant, a state Senate district director, and chief of staff for former Representative Alan Lowenthal.",
        "cites": [1, 2],
        "sentences": [
